{"id":"430895","name":"鲫鱼炖豆腐","author":"雨中漫步li","authorId":"10274398","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/430895/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鲫鱼","amount":"3条"},{"name":"豆腐","amount":"100克"}],"sub":[{"name":"莴苣","amount":"适量"},{"name":"芹菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"花生油","amount":"2勺"},{"name":"葱","amount":"少许"},{"name":"姜","amount":"少许"},{"name":"大料","amount":"少许"},{"name":"花椒","amount":"少许"},{"name":"盐","amount":"少许"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鲫鱼去鳞，去内脏，头去掉。","img":"images/430895/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"豆腐切好。","img":"images/430895/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"芹菜.莴苣.胡萝卜切好备用。","img":"images/430895/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"葱.姜.花椒.大料准备好。","img":"images/430895/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅内放油烧热，放入花椒.大料.葱.姜炒香。","img":"images/430895/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入鲫鱼，慢慢煎出香味。","img":"images/430895/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"鲫鱼煎好。","img":"images/430895/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"到入开始，这样炖的鱼汤奶白色。","img":"images/430895/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入豆腐。","img":"images/430895/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"告诉锅盖，中火慢炖20分钟。","img":"images/430895/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"时间到了，放入盐，胡椒粉调味。","img":"images/430895/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入青菜。","img":"images/430895/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"青菜放入炖5分钟就可以了。","img":"images/430895/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/430895/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}